# Production cron jobs run inside Docker services.
#
# Data pipelines: `cron` container
# LSTM training:  `cron-train` container (GPU)
#
# Start the stack:
#   make docker-up-prod
#
# Host crontab is NOT required. Reference schedule below.

# cron (docker/cron/crontab)
# 0 6 * * *    MOEX candles       -> asset_parser --incremental
# 30 6 * * *   news parsing       -> news_parser --incremental
# 0 7 * * *    news enrichment    -> news_processor --incremental

# cron-train (docker/cron-train/crontab)
# 0 8 * * 0    LSTM retrain       -> run-lstm-retrain.sh (LKOH, ROSN, TCSG PRD)
